			"notes": "This is the first kind-of release! We changed many things and added new content, so go and check [the README](https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/blob/main/README.md)!\n\nFor infos on how to install, read [this](https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/blob/main/README.md#install--play).\n\n## What's Changed\n* Hound  and wretch immune to magma block by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/7\n* changed ingot to nugget by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/10\n* Almond water is resetting your wretched cycle and restoring 4 hunger... by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/9\n* Added megalophobia to level 0 by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/11\n* CrateBlock is waterloggable by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/8\n* Bug fixes by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/15\n* Game Rule for respawning by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/14\n* World generation by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/16\n* crate blocks placed by warehouse chunk generator are now filled with loot from the loot table by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/17\n* Level 0 and Cement Halls in Level 1 use Loot table for every generated barrel/crate by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/18\n* 1.20.1 by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/19\n* Fixed accesswidener by @encryptionstudio in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/20\n\n## New Contributors\n* @masela01 made their first contribution in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/3\n* @chocotoneg made their first contribution in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/4\n* @encryptionstudio made their first contribution in https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/pull/7\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Backrooms-Mod/backrooms-mod/compare/ADDON-API...v0.1.0"
